  "content_html": "<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/assets/images/content/0352cbb60e412587c1.png\" style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 1em; outline: none; padding: 0px; transition: all; vertical-align: baseline;\"><img alt=\"רישום של ילד עם כובע מצחייה\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"291\" data-original-width=\"219\" src=\"/assets/images/content/0352cbb60e412587c1.png\" style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; margin: 0px; max-width: 100%; outline: none; padding: 0px; position: relative; text-decoration-line: none; vertical-align: baseline;\" /></a></p><h2><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">🎈 שִׂיחָה בְּסִמָּנִים – מִגְדַּל בָּבֶל</span></h2><h2><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: 400;\">👑&nbsp;<b>הַמֶּלֶךְ נִמְרוֹד</b>&nbsp;(מְפַתֶּה):<br />בּוֹאוּ אַחֲרַי.<br />נִבְנֶה מִגְדָּל עַד הַשָּׁמַיִם — וּמִשָּׁם נִשְׁלֹט בְּכָל העוֹלָם.<br /><br />🎖️&nbsp;<b>הַמִּשְׁנֶה לַמֶּלֶךְ</b>&nbsp;(בְּקוֹל מִתְחַנֵּף):<br />רַעֲיוֹן נֶהֱדָר מַלְכִּי הַגָּאוֹן.<br />וּבְאוֹתָהּ הִזְדַּמְּנוּת נְגַרֵּשׁ אֶת ה' מֵהַשָּׁמַיִם.<br /><br />🧱&nbsp;<b>הַפּוֹעֲלִים</b>&nbsp;(מִתְאַסְּפִים בִּקְבוּצוֹת):<br />נַעֲשֶׂה לְבֵנִים — נָכִין טִיט, נַעֲלֶה וּנְטַפֵּס לִבְנוֹת אֶת הַמִּגְדָּל!<br /><br />☁️&nbsp;<b>ה' בַּשָּׁמַיִם</b>&nbsp;(מִתְעַצֵּב):<br />שׁוּב הֵם חוֹטְאִים בְּגַאֲוָה וּבִמְרִידָה.<br />אֲבַלְבֵּל אֶת שְׂפָתָם.<br /><br />👷‍♀️&nbsp;<b>פּוֹעֶלֶת</b>&nbsp;(בְּרֹאשׁ הַמִּגְדָּל):<br />תָּבִיאוּ לִי דָּחוּף \"קְרַמ־פּוּף\" (הִיא הִתְכַּוְּנָה לִדְלִי).<br /><br />👷&nbsp;<b>פּוֹעֵל</b>&nbsp;(בַּקּוֹמָה הָרִאשׁוֹנָה):<br />אָה, הִיא מִתְכַּוֶּנֶת לְמַבְרֵג. אָבִיא לָהּ.<br /><br />🧱&nbsp;<b>פּוֹעֲלִים</b>&nbsp;(צוֹעֲקִים):<br />מָה קוֹרֶה פֹּה? אֵיזֶה בָּלָגָן.<br /><br />👷&nbsp;<b>פּוֹעֵל</b>&nbsp;(בַּקּוֹמָה הָרִאשׁוֹנָה):<br />יֹפִי. עַכְשָׁו בָּלָגָן.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אַל תַּפְרִיעוּ לִי לִישֹׁן</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">!<br />(בַּשָּׂפָה שֶׁלּוֹ, '</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בָּלָגָן'&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: 400;\">זֶה מְנוּחַת צָהֳרַיִם).<br /><br />🤜🤛&nbsp;<b>רִיב גָּדוֹל</b>:<br />כֻּלָּם הִתְחִילוּ לִצְעֹק וּלְקַלֵּל בְּשָׂפוֹת שׁוֹנוֹת.<br />וַאֲפִלּוּ נָתְנוּ אֶחָד לַשֵּׁנִי בְּעִיטוֹת (בְּאוֹתָהּ שָׂפָה).<br /><br />🌍&nbsp;<b>הַתּוֹצָאָה</b>:<br />הַקְּבוּצָה נִפְרְדָה - אִישׁ אִישׁ לַשָּׂפָה שֶׁלּוֹ.<br />הַמִּגְדָּל נֶחֱרַב.<br /><br />📖&nbsp;<b>הַתּוֹרָה</b>&nbsp;(מְלַמֶּדֶת):<br />הַתָּכְנִית הָרָעָה שֶׁל נִמְרוֹד, שֶׁרָצָה לִמְרֹד בָּהּ' - לֹא הִצְלִיחָה.<br />אִם מִתְאַחֲדִים לְצֹרֶךְ דָּבָר רַע - אֵין הַצְלָחָה.</span></h2><div><div><div style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: right; vertical-align: baseline;\"><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">תפזורת מקצועית</span></span></h2></div><div style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">מצאו את&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; font-weight: bold; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">🔍</strong><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;המספרים המוזכרים בפרשה: שְׁלֹשָׁה, חֲמִשִּׁים, שְׁלֹשִׁים, שִׁבְעָה, אַרְבָּעִים, שֵׁשׁ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">.</span></span></span></div><div style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">בכיוונים&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">⬅️ ➡️ ⬇️ ⬆️</span></span></span></div><div style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br /><a href=\"/assets/images/content/e17d2e10438a12d949.png\" style=\"background-color: transparent; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: center;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"458\" data-original-width=\"464\" height=\"316\" src=\"/assets/images/content/e17d2e10438a12d949.png\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></span></h2><h2 style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">נכון או לא בפרשה?</span></span></h2></div><ol data-end=\"1230\" data-start=\"88\"><li data-end=\"157\" data-start=\"88\"><p data-end=\"157\" data-start=\"91\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">נֹחַ נצטווה לבנות תֵּבָה מעֲצֵי אֶרֶז?</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"196\" data-start=\"158\">\n<p data-end=\"196\" data-start=\"161\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">נֹחַ בנה את התיבה במשך 120 שנה?</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"262\" data-start=\"197\">\n<p data-end=\"262\" data-start=\"200\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מן החיות הטהורות הוכנסו לתיבה 3 זוגות?</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"304\" data-start=\"263\">\n<p data-end=\"304\" data-start=\"266\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מהחיות הטמאות הוכנס זוג אחד בלבד?</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"382\" data-start=\"305\">\n<p data-end=\"382\" data-start=\"308\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">המים כיסו גם את ההרים הגבוהים?</span></p></li>\n<li data-end=\"461\" data-start=\"421\">\n<p data-end=\"461\" data-start=\"424\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">נֹחַ שלח את העורב לבדוק אם יבשה הארץ?</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"533\" data-start=\"462\">\n<p data-end=\"533\" data-start=\"465\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">היונה חזרה בפעם הראשונה עם עלה זית בפיה?</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"534\">\n<p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"537\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בני נֹחַ היו שם, חם ויפת?</span></p></li>\n<li data-end=\"891\" data-start=\"815\">\n<p data-end=\"891\" data-start=\"819\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כנען, בנו של חם, נתקלל להיות עבד לאחיו?</span></p></li><li data-end=\"891\" data-start=\"815\"><p data-end=\"891\" data-start=\"819\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בעקבות בלבול השפה – התפזרו האנשים על פני כל הארץ?</span></p></li>\n</ol><br /></div>"
}
